<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Lockpost — Secure PGP Message</title>
</head>
<body style="margin:0;padding:24px 0;background-color:#0f172a;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#e2e8f0;line-height:1.6;">

<div style="background-color:#0f172a;padding:0;margin:0;text-align:center;">
    <div style="max-width:680px;background-color:#1e293b;border:1px solid #334155;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 4px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);display:inline-block;text-align:left;">

        <!-- Header -->
        <div style="background-color:#090d16;padding:24px 32px;border-bottom:1px solid #334155;">
            <h1 style="margin:0;font-size:20px;font-weight:700;color:#38bdf8;letter-spacing:-0.3px;">
                🔒 Lockpost &mdash; Secure Encrypted Message
            </h1>
            <p style="margin:6px 0 0;font-size:13px;color:#94a3b8;font-style:italic;">
                Share a link. Receive a secret. Leave no trace.
            </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Instructions -->
        <div style="padding:24px 32px 16px;">
            <p style="margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;color:#f8fafc;">
                How to decrypt and verify this message:
            </p>
            <ol style="margin:0;padding-left:20px;font-size:14px;color:#cbd5e1;line-height:1.6;">
                <li style="margin-bottom:6px;">
                    <strong>Decrypt:</strong> Copy the <em>1. Encrypted Message</em> block below and decrypt it with your PGP private key (using GnuPG, Kleopatra, Mailvelope, etc.).
                </li>
                <li style="margin-bottom:6px;">
                    <strong>Verify:</strong> You can paste the <em>2. Server-Signed Message</em> into the <a href="{{ app_verify_url }}" style="color:#38bdf8;text-decoration:underline;">Lockpost Verify Page</a> to confirm authenticity.
                </li>
            </ol>
            <p style="margin:12px 0 0;font-size:12px;color:#94a3b8;">
                Verification happens entirely client-side &mdash; zero persistent server storage.
            </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Divider -->
        <div style="padding:0 32px;"><hr style="border:none;border-top:1px solid #334155;margin:0;"></div>

        <!-- Section 1: Encrypted Message (Directly visible) -->
        <div style="padding:20px 32px;">
            <h2 style="margin:0 0 6px;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:#38bdf8;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.5px;">
                1. Encrypted Message (For Your Private Key)
            </h2>
            <p style="margin:0 0 8px;font-size:12px;color:#94a3b8;">
                The raw PGP ciphertext encrypted with your public key:
            </p>
            <pre style="margin:0;padding:16px;background-color:#090d16;border:1px solid #334155;border-radius:6px;font-family:'Courier New',Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;color:#38bdf8;white-space:pre-wrap;word-break:break-all;line-height:1.4;">{{ message | e }}</pre>
        </div>

        <!-- Divider -->
        <div style="padding:0 32px;"><hr style="border:none;border-top:1px solid #334155;margin:0;"></div>

        <!-- Section 2: Server-Signed Message -->
        <div style="padding:20px 32px;">
            <h2 style="margin:0 0 6px;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:#94a3b8;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.5px;">
                2. Server-Signed Message Block (For Signature Verification)
            </h2>
            <p style="margin:0 0 8px;font-size:12px;color:#94a3b8;">
                Signed by the Lockpost server private key before sending. Paste this block into the
                <a href="{{ app_verify_url }}" style="color:#38bdf8;text-decoration:underline;">Lockpost Verify Page</a>
                to confirm authenticity:
            </p>
            <pre style="margin:0;padding:16px;background-color:#090d16;border:1px solid #334155;border-radius:6px;font-family:'Courier New',Courier,monospace;font-size:11px;color:#cbd5e1;white-space:pre-wrap;word-break:break-all;line-height:1.4;">{{ message_signature | e }}</pre>
        </div>

        <!-- Divider -->
        <div style="padding:0 32px;"><hr style="border:none;border-top:1px solid #334155;margin:0;"></div>

        <!-- Section 3: Server Public Key -->
        <div style="padding:20px 32px 28px;">
            <h2 style="margin:0 0 6px;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:#64748b;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.5px;">
                3. Server Public Key
            </h2>
            <p style="margin:0 0 8px;font-size:12px;color:#94a3b8;">
                Used to verify signatures originating from this Lockpost server:
            </p>
            <pre style="margin:0;padding:12px;background-color:#090d16;border:1px solid #334155;border-radius:6px;font-family:'Courier New',Courier,monospace;font-size:10px;color:#64748b;white-space:pre-wrap;word-break:break-all;line-height:1.3;">{{ server_public_key | e }}</pre>
        </div>

        <!-- Footer -->
        <div style="background-color:#090d16;border-top:1px solid #334155;padding:16px 32px;text-align:center;">
            <p style="margin:0;font-size:12px;color:#64748b;">
                Lockpost &bull; Zero storage &bull; Client-side encrypted &bull; <a href="{{ app_verify_url }}" style="color:#38bdf8;text-decoration:none;">Verify online</a>
            </p>
        </div>

    </div>
</div>

</body>
</html>
